sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as React dashboard
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant P as Prometheus
    participant AM as Alertmanager
    participant N as Slack / Teams

    User->>UI: Create rule, e.g. daily cost above $520
    UI->>API: POST /api/alerts/rules
    API->>DB: Store rule
    loop every 30 s
        P->>API: GET /metrics
        API->>DB: Evaluate each enabled rule against current data
        API-->>P: devops_alert_rule_breached{rule_id, severity} 0 or 1
    end
    Note over P: Breached for 2 minutes: DashboardRuleBreached fires
    P->>AM: Alert (labels carry rule_id)
    Note over AM: Group, de-duplicate, repeat every 4 h
    AM->>API: POST /api/alerts/webhook
    API->>DB: Record alert event (firing)
    API->>N: Formatted message with value and threshold
    User->>UI: Delete or disable the rule
    Note over P: Metric disappears, alert resolves
    P->>AM: Resolved
    AM->>API: POST /api/alerts/webhook (resolved)
    API->>DB: Set ends_at, status resolved
    API->>N: Resolved message
